<< /A 3729 0 R /Alt (Fig. 1: The figure shows two contrasting gameplay scenarios. Panel A has two section, the upper section depicts older adults holding standard game controllers and struggling with complex button mappings and fine motor control, resulting in visible difficulty. The lower section depicts older adults using intuitive body gestures in front of a camera to interact with the game, which leads to increased motivation and engagement. Panel B shows a hybrid interaction approach where body-based gestures are used for expressive in-game actions, while joystick input is retained for character movement, enabling gameplay without modifying the original game mechanics.\000) /C /adbe_style_000008 /ID (AD260421-2200-1186-ADBE-000000007664) /K 30 /P 1262 0 R /Pg 4052 0 R /S /Figure >>
endobj
